;Duke Street I - Ray's original plus resurvey

*begin TempDukeStreet

*export DukeStreet1.059
*export DukeStreet1.073

*Include DukeStreet1
*Include DukeStreetDigs

*Include dukest1resurvey2009
*Include dukest1resurvey2009bp
*Include dukest1resurveybpcorr
*Include dukest1resurvey2009corr

*Include ropepitch
*Include whirlpool
*Include Whirlpool1

*equate DukeStreet1.073 dukest1resurvey2009.1	;compare two surveys of Duke St 1
*equate DukeStreet1.073 dukest1resurvey2009bp.1	;compare three surveys of Duke St 1
*equate DukeStreet1.073 dukest1resurveybpcorr.1	;compare four surveys of Duke St 1
*equate DukeStreet1.073 dukest1resurvey2009corr.1	;compare five surveys of Duke St 1

*equate ropepitch.1 dukest1resurvey2009.21
*equate whirlpool.6x dukest1resurvey2009.6
*equate whirlpool.6x Whirlpool1.002

*equate DukeStreet1.059 DukeStreetDigs.005	;Duke Street Digs off Duke Street

*end TempDukeStreet